>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"consumable\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Consumable</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"yes-tick\" title=\"Yes\">✓</span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"regenseconds\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Regeneration</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">0 seconds<br/><small>(0% full)</small></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"implemented\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Version</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">8.50<br/><span class=\"implementation-date\">July 1, 2009<br/>Summer Update 2009</span></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\">See also: Objects<span class=\"explained\">Help</span></nav>\n</aside>\n<div id=\"w-twbox-intro\">\n<div id=\"w-object-profile\">\n<div id=\"w-twbox-image\"><img alt=\"latest?cb=20090802161330&amp;path-prefix=en&amp;format=original\" class=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Tropical_Fried_Terrorbird_c34362.gif\"/></div>\n<div id=\"w-twbox-look\"><div class=\"item-look tibiatext tibiagreen\">You see  tropical fried terrorbird.<div class=\"p-weight\">It weighs 7.80 oz.</div><div class=\"p-flavortext\">It's the ideal snack for a beach barbeque.</div><br/></div></div>\n<div class=\"\" id=\"w-twbox-sounds\"><span class=\"tibiatext tibiaorange\"><ul class=\"sound-list\"><li>Chomp.</li></ul></span></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-object-notes\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Notes\">Notes</span></h3>\n<p>It will boost your Magic Level by 5 for one hour. It cannot be used with a <span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Mastermind%20Potion\"><img alt=\"Mastermind Potion\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Mastermind_Potion_496d18.gif\" width=\"32\"/></a></span></span> <a href=\"#/wiki/Mastermind%20Potion\">Mastermind Potion</a> to stack effects.\n</p><p>When using a Tropical Fried Terrorbird, <span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Green Sparkles Effect\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Green_Sparkles_Effect_f26b9f.gif\" width=\"32\"/></span></span> Green Sparkles Effect will appear on the user who will get the following message: \"<span class=\"tibiatext tibiawhite\">Your magic level increases for one hour.</span>\"\n</p><p>To create this dish, you must speak with the <a href=\"#/wiki/Djinn\">Djinn</a> <a href=\"#/wiki/Jean%20Pierre\">Jean Pierre</a> in <a href=\"#/wiki/Ankrahmun\">Ankrahmun</a>, near the Marid Fortress, during the Hot Cuisine event.\n</p><p><b>Necessary Ingredients:</b>\n</p>\n<ul><li>1 Fresh <a href=\"#/wiki/Dead%20Chicken\">Dead Chicken</a> <span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Chicken\"><img alt=\"Chicken\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Chicken_15646d.gif\" width=\"32\"/></a></span></span></li>\n<li>2 <a href=\"#/wiki/Lemon\">Lemons</a> <span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Lemon\"><img alt=\"Lemon\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Lemon_8f1a93.gif\" width=\"32\"/></a></span></span></li>\n<li>2 <a href=\"#/wiki/Orange\">Oranges</a> <span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Orange\"><img alt=\"Orange\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Orange_588bb0.gif\" width=\"32\"/></a></span></span></li>\n<li>2 <a href=\"#/wiki/Mango\">Mangoes</a> <span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Mango\"><img alt=\"Mango\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Mango_339e70.gif\" width=\"32\"/></a></span></span></li>\n<li>2 <a href=\"#/wiki/Vial\">Vials</a> of <a href=\"#/wiki/Coconut%20Milk\">Coconut Milk</a> <span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Coconut%20Milk\"><img alt=\"Coconut Milk\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Coconut_Milk_f8bb14.gif\" width=\"32\"/></a></span></span></li>\n<li>1 <a href=\"#/wiki/Stone%20Herb\">Stone Herb</a> <span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Stone%20Herb\"><img alt=\"Stone Herb\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Stone_Herb_cb4aaf.gif\" width=\"32\"/></a></span></span></li></ul>\n<p>Only obtainable through the <a href=\"#/quest/hot-cuisine-quest\">Hot Cuisine Quest</a>.\n</p>\n</div>\n<p><br/>\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-item-droppedby\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Dropped_By\">Dropped By</span></h3>\n<div class=\"item-droppedby-wrapper\">\n<ul class=\"creature-list-generic no-results\"><li>This item is not dropped by any creatures.</li></ul>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-item-trades\">\n<h3 class=\"semantic-header\"><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Trade_Details\">Trade Details</span></h3>\n<div class=\"trades\"><h4><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Buy_From\">Buy From</span></h4><p class=\"no-results\">No NPC sells this item.</p></div>\n<div class=\"trades\"><h4><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Sell_To\">Sell To</span></h4><p class=\"no-results\">No NPC buys this item.</p></div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div class=\"navigation\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Related_Pages\">Related Pages</span></h3>\n<div class=\"navigation-body navigation-list-wrapper\">\n<ul><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Coconut%20Milk\">Coconut Milk</a></li><li>Death Damage</li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Food\">Food</a></li><li><a href=\"#/quest/hot-cuisine-quest\">Hot Cuisine Quest</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Lemon\">Lemon</a></li><li>Magic Level</li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Mango\">Mango</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Mastermind%20Potion\">Mastermind Potion</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Orange\">Orange</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Stone%20Herb\">Stone Herb</a></li><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Vial\">Vial</a></li></ul>\n</div>\n</div></div></div>","quests":["hot-cuisine-quest"],"howto":{"quests":[{"slug":"hot-cuisine-quest","quest":"Hot Cuisine Quest","step":"2-3","n":10,"title":"Prato 4: Tropical Fried Terrorbird","kind":"reward","coords":[{"x":33068,"y":32531,"z":6,"label":"Jean Pierre"}]},{"slug":"hot-cuisine-quest","quest":"Hot Cuisine Quest","step":"4-0","n":24,"title":"Efeitos dos pratos","kind":"reward","coords":[]}]}}